# Architecture

See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

## MUST

- Keep `handler` → `services` / `utils` / `constants` / `types`
- Call Anthropic only from `src/services/claude.ts`
- Sanitize/limit history before Claude (`sanitizeHistory`)
- Preserve CloudFormation split (Lambda template vs API/role/S3)

## MUST NOT

- Put business/LLM logic in the handler beyond orchestration
- Import the handler from services
- Bypass validation for message length or history shape
